 e['fitness'])\n        print(f\"  Best fitness     : {best['fitness']:.2f}  ({best['title']})\")\ndict_keys(['id', 'title', 'category', 'motivation', 'hypothesis', 'expected_impact', 'changes', 'outcome', 'fitness', 'delta_pct', 'vs_baseline', 'fmax_mhz', 'ipc_coremark', 'cycles', 'iterations', 'lut4', 'ff', 'seeds', 'perturbations', 'lutram', 'bsram', 'dsp', 'critical_path', 'logic_levels', 'formal_passed', 'cosim_passed', 'error', 'implementation_notes', 'timestamp', 'slot', 'round_id', 'lesson'])\n\nNone\n{'motivation': \"A fresh Gowin run reproduced the champion's 104.134 MHz median. The\\nmedian placements have nearly tied setup paths in the wide radix-16\\nrecurrence, from EX forwarding throug\n…[3153 of 6225 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:2109e8dce5c13b1d]…\nor divide and remainder. Decode mutually exclusive capture enables for the SUB and divider words before the execute stage.'}, {'file': 'rtl/ex_stage.sv', 'description': 'Remove divide from the shared integer and special result word and capture the completed divider word on the SUB lane using the registered enables. Preserve adjacent bypass and the captured architectural source operands.'}, {'file': 'rtl/core_pkg.sv', 'description': 'Carry the two capture enables in the ID/EX bundle.'}, {'file': 'test/test_alu.py', 'description': 'Exercise exact signed and unsigned results around divisor magnitudes 4095, 4096, 131071 and 131072, plus zero, overflow, all quotient digits, the fixed result latency and output holds.'}, {'file': 'test/test_pipeline.py', 'description': 'Check adjacent dependent and independent divide successors, including a second divide, a branch, a store and x0. Exercise divide completion with data backpressure and check exact RVFI source values, PC continuity and contiguous retirement order.'}]}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
