{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_60","type":"agent_message","text":"The strongest scratch variant lets the branch resolver retire during repair and registers forwarding eligibility in decode. It preserved the local CoreMark cycle count and matched all four ISS traces with and without stalls. Its 106.678 MHz median is about 0.064 MHz below the acceptance floor, so I’m checking whether related control simplifications close that gap."}}
