\\nThe selected implementation also gives the shifter a separate EX/MEM forwarding lane to shorten the ALU result path. Ordered branches bias the operand sign bits for a shared signed and unsigned comparison.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- Verilator `--lint-only -Wall -Wno-MULTITOP` passed.\\n- All six pytest runners passed, including every reciprocal ROM index, signed threshold boundaries, held completion, dependent divides, JALR into a divide and stalled writeback forwarding.\\n- The unchanged single-retire formal suite passed all 53 checks, including liveness and register consistency.\\n- An intermedia\n…[7900 of 10972 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:9160e20bdbfbe4d3]…\nd all five CRCs and completed 10 iterations in 3,750,582 marker cycles. Gowin placement options 0, 1, and 2 measured 95.873, 101.544, and 101.544 MHz. The median yielded 270.74 iterations/s against the 262.57 iterations/s floor. The option 0 critical path starts in the registered JALR repair control and ends in FIFO occupancy.\\n'}\nhyp-20261121-002-r10s1 {'cycles': 3624672, 'fitness': 272.92, 'fmax_mhz': 98.925, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_ex/reg_q.mem_addr_3_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_if/gen_replay_lane[2].slot_word_gen_replay_lane[2].slot_word_0_22_s', 'slack_ns': -6.589, 'arrival_ns': 16.883, 'logic_cells': 10, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_if']}, 'implementation_notes': ''}\nhyp-20261121-002-r11s1 {'cycles': 3621253, 'fitness': 280.89, 'fmax_mhz': 101.716, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_ex/u_div/wide_dividend_quotient_q_21_s0', 'to': 'cpu/u_ex/u_div/wide_remainder_q_2_s0', 'slack_ns': -5.109, 'arrival_ns': 15.403, 'logic_cells': 42, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_div']}, 'implementation_notes': ''}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
