r the next bus\\nrequest. Keep the unreset payload in asynchronous distributed RAM.\\nPredict conditional transfers taken in the top two states of a\\nsaturating two-bit counter, and train JAL and JALR strongly taken.\\nFall through on a miss. Only replay from entries whose target and\\ntarget successor fit in the 1 MiB instruction window.\\n\\nEach accepted imem read creates one entry in a four-packet FIFO.\\nOn a predicte\n…[34291 of 37363 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:cb9f58253c84d982]…\ng.\"},{\"file\":\"rtl/if_stage.sv\",\"description\":\"Learn terminal direction per table entry, select the resume PC when writing the entry, and apply the sampled one-hot terminal prediction at validated lane issue. Calculate correction refill credit independently.\"},{\"file\":\"rtl/id_stage.sv\",\"description\":\"Prequalify taken and fall-through repair enables from the accepted instruction and its validated prediction.\"},{\"file\":\"rtl/ex_stage.sv\",\"description\":\"Use the registered enables to resolve direct prediction misses. Keep divide wait independent of repair for FIFO credits and gate divider issue and EX/MEM side effects during repair.\"},{\"file\":\"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\",\"description\":\"Separate ordinary issue eligibility from the registered repair that flushes ID and owns FIFO refill.\"},{\"file\":\"test/test_pipeline.py\",\"description\":\"Exercise a one-word prefix containing a direct transfer, terminal counter reversal and repair, stalls, exact alias rejection, and FENCE.I. Check retirement PCs, order and accepted stores.\"}]}\n\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
