n  bank comparing its four-bit tag before selecting the match. Keep the\n  following-cycle full in-window PC and exact source-word validation.\n  From the same table snapshot, capture the saved source direction,\n  physical trace row, resume PC, length, repeat bit, and first replay\n  record. Keep the short-tag steering decision independent of the\n  re\n…[2829 of 5901 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:1cbd3b9edfbf66c4]…\n.\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: Feed the trainer the ordered MEM/WB retirement records and route published descriptors and RAM fills to IF.\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: Remove the old predictor-training taps while retaining the registered architectural successor and ordinary direction repair.\n  - file: rtl/replay_train.sv\n    description: Collect finite paths and closed loops through resolved direct transfers and stage descriptor publication.\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: Queue validated trace handles, sequence buffered synchronous reads and loop wrap, and preserve speculative response rejection and repair priority.\n  - file: rtl/replay_store.sv\n    description: Store trace records with a synchronous read port and a separate write port for an unreferenced physical image.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: Cover continuous replay at entry and wrap, interior branch reversal under bus stalls, descriptor replacement while a slot is live, and FENCE.I invalidation.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
